1.Write an end-to-end test scenario for booking a movie ticket on BookMyShow, starting from searching for a movie to completing the payment and receiving a booking confirmation.
Answer :
Test Scenario: Verify that a user can successfully search for a movie, select a show, book seats, make payment, and receive a booking confirmation.
1)Open BookMyShow and select a city.
2)Search and select a movie.
3)Choose theatre, date, and show time.
4)Select available seats.
5)Review booking details and click Proceed to Pay.
6)Select a payment method and complete payment.
7)Verify successful payment.
8)Verify that the booking confirmation and ticket/booking ID are generated.


